1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Ambulance arrives in 28s.
Its route is blocked.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
This is SemaFrame.
An AI-readable, operable 3D workspace.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I give it one goal:
“Open the route. Hit nothing.”

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The AI reads dispatch data.
ETA 28s · 1.6m clear · read-only.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
It reads every object:
position · size · collider · actions.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
This position hits a street tree.
Rejected; scene unchanged.

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Five safe endpoints.
Preflight: 5/5 passed.

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,500
AI proposes. A human confirms.
11 changes await one commit.

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,500
One click triggers 11 actions.
One atomic commit.

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,500
Vehicles yield.
Signals and route synchronize.

11
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Hospital reached.
Final state: 0 conflicts.

12
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Undo · redo · save · reopen.
The editable state survives.

13
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Not a rendered clip.
An editable 3D world · SemaFrame.
